<section class="pw-card pw-stack"><h2>Before Production Starts</h2><p>Create a work order by selecting the site, finished good, quantity and required date. The approved product mapping supplies its recipe, inventory SKU, unit and warehouses. A linked plan is created in the background.</p><p>The manager reviews the draft and selects <strong>Release for Material Issue</strong>. A draft cannot issue materials or begin production.</p><p class="pw-muted">For sales demand, the Customer order runs ATP first. An approved shortage plan can still be used to create a linked work order; existing stock is allocated before more FG is produced.</p></section>
